# propose_to_buy — a trader met off their premises is not offered the trade
#
# The other half of on_premises.cli. The poultry keeper sells foodstuff and is a close friend under
# --npc-affinity, so every condition but one is met: at location id 1 under --npc-static they stand in
# the Chicken Coop, and the farm trades only from its Storage Shed. `goal propose_to_buy` therefore
# finds no such goal and falls back to the others (stdout carries the --goal-only miss line), and
# whatever runs instead is the assertion.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --auto-dialogue --npc-affinity CloseFriend --location-type farm --location-id 1 --npc-static --start-area "Chicken Coop" --period noon --observe-only "poultry_keeper"

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60

strategy succeed
goal propose_to_buy
advance 12 180

click keyword 0
choose 0
choose 0
advance 12 180

click action 0
choose 0
advance 12 180
click continue
advance 12 180
expect-no-verb propose_to_buy

# This script tests an ABSENCE: `--goal-only propose_to_buy` finding no such goal is the gate
# holding, so its miss must not fail the run.
allow-flag-miss --goal-only
quit
